{"id":"75f38e468e1b4620","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-theory.md","title":"语义闭理论","display":"df-theory — 语义闭理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-theory","aliases":["56-df-theory"],"display":"df-theory — 语义闭理论","depends_on":["[[56-df-logical-consequence]]"],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory — 语义闭理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59f2769e44131c6a\" href=\"?note=59f2769e44131c6a\" title=\"56-df-logical-consequence\">56-df-logical-consequence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)\">\\(L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)\">\\(\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)\\)</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)\\)</span> 与语义后承见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59f2769e44131c6a\" href=\"?note=59f2769e44131c6a\" title=\"56-df-logical-consequence\">56-df-logical-consequence</a>。本节点采用语义闭合的理论约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;(T\\models_L\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\varphi\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;(T\\models_L\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\varphi\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\exists I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F_L}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)}}\\;\\exists J\\in\\prod_{P\\in P_L}\\mathcal P(A^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;((A,I,J)\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Con}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\exists I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F_L}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)}}\\;\\exists J\\in\\prod_{P\\in P_L}\\mathcal P(A^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;((A,I,J)\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_L(T)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;(\\varphi\\in T\\lor(\\neg\\varphi)\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Complete}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_L(T)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;(\\varphi\\in T\\lor(\\neg\\varphi)\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_L(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Th}_L(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>辅助约定：这里的 Con 是可满足性，不冒充相对某个未指定证明系统的句法一致性。旧文理论、可证关系互相循环且 Con 无定义；现已固定其语义含义。没有在此宣称一阶完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"59f2769e44131c6a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"59f2769e44131c6a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$，$\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)$，设 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)$ 与语义后承见 [[56-df-logical-consequence]]。本节点采用语义闭合的理论约定；$\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_L=(F_L,\\mathrm{ar}_L)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;(T\\models_L\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\varphi\\in T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\exists I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F_L}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}_L(f)}}\\;\\exists J\\in\\prod_{P\\in P_L}\\mathcal P(A^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;((A,I,J)\\models\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}_L(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_L(T)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;(\\varphi\\in T\\lor(\\neg\\varphi)\\in T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_L(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L:\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1705,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-688","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["59f2769e44131c6a"]}